msgid "Remove application \"%1$s\" from the map?"
msgstr "Ukloniti aplikaciju \"%1$s\" s karte?"

msgid "Remove service \"%1$s\" from the map?"
msgstr "Ukloniti uslugu \"%1$s\" s karte?"

msgid "Its services, databases and external calls leave the map. Services shared with other applications stay."
msgstr "Njezine usluge, baze podataka i vanjski pozivi nestaju s karte. Usluge dijeljene s drugim aplikacijama ostaju."

msgid "The service, its connections, databases and external calls leave the map."
msgstr "Usluga, njezine veze, baze podataka i vanjski pozivi nestaju s karte."

msgid "If the application is discovered again in new traces, it is recreated automatically, with all its entities."
msgstr "Ako se aplikacija ponovno otkrije u novim tragovima, automatski se ponovno stvara sa svim svojim entitetima."

msgid "If the service is discovered again in new traces, it is recreated automatically, with all its entities."
msgstr "Ako se usluga ponovno otkrije u novim tragovima, automatski se ponovno stvara sa svim svojim entitetima."

msgid "Hosts, items and triggers in Zabbix are not changed."
msgstr "Računala, stavke i okidači u Zabbixu se ne mijenjaju."

msgid "Remove %1$s"
msgstr "Ukloni %1$s"

msgid "No data found"
msgstr "Nema pronađenih podataka"

msgid "No APM span matches the attribute filter in the selected time range. Change the filter above or press Reset to see everything."
msgstr "Nijedan APM span ne odgovara filtru atributa u odabranom vremenskom rasponu. Promijenite filtar iznad ili pritisnite Poništi da vidite sve."

msgid "No APM traces in the selected time range and no host with the apm.requests item. Services appear here as soon as the applications send traces to the Zabbix proxy."
msgstr "Nema APM tragova u odabranom vremenskom rasponu i nema računala sa stavkom apm.requests. Usluge se ovdje pojavljuju čim aplikacije pošalju tragove Zabbix proxyju."

